guide polestar-completionist-horde/craftsmans-writs
title Craftsman's Writs (Completionist)
faction Horde
category Miscellaneous
levels 1-60
zone Orgrimmar
pitch The Craftsman's Writ crafting contracts: each starts from its writ in your bags.

step About this guide
  note A Craftsman's Writ is a crafting contract that starts from the writ item. Every step is optional and shows only while you carry its writ.

step Craftsman's Writ: Elixir of Ogre's Strength
